  'latestRelease.section.maintenance': 'Files and maintenance',
  'latestRelease.item.tools': 'Added a gradient tool with pixel-accurate previews and no-dither, dither, checker, horizontal, vertical, and diagonal presets.',
  'latestRelease.item.selection': 'Selection move, scale, rotate, shear, mirror, and paste previews now remain stable without stale pixels or repeated-mirror reversion.',
  'latestRelease.item.layers': 'Layers now contain an Aseprite-style animation timeline with cel multi-selection, linking, copy/paste, reordering, and per-frame properties.',
  'latestRelease.item.dragDrop': 'Workspace projects can be docked between top tabs and internal split windows with more reliable external entry, direction switching, and closing.',
  'latestRelease.item.shortcuts': 'Added gradient, pixel-grid, and custom-grid shortcuts, with shortcut hints in frame, cel, and layer context menus.',
  'latestRelease.item.dialogs': 'Timelapse, grid-settings, and project-information dialogs now use adaptive layouts, component scrollbars, and top-level export progress feedback.',
  'latestRelease.item.rendering': 'Canvas and preview rendering preserve the full pixel source, use fixed-ratio scaling, and smooth only when reduced to prevent large-animation distortion.',
  'latestRelease.item.preview': 'Added timelapse preview and video export with duration or speed modes, integer quality scales, and MP4 as the default format.',
  'latestRelease.item.mirror': 'Symmetry now supports vertical, horizontal, and both diagonal axes with locking, color/width adjustment, positioning, and reset controls.',
  'latestRelease.item.input': 'Selections, frames, and cels support Ctrl disjoint selection, Shift ranges, arrow-key nudging, and blue-outline dragging.',
  'latestRelease.item.preferences': 'Preferences now cover pixel and custom grids, gradient presets, native language labels, and automatic drawing-process recording.',
  'latestRelease.item.colors': 'The color editor supports LAB and CMYK; palette locking, foreground/background synchronization, and color presets are consistent.',
  'latestRelease.item.cursor': 'Updated pixel cursor assets for gradients, symmetry, and dragging; brush previews are recalculated after canvas resizing.',
  'latestRelease.item.format': 'Improved multi-group Aseprite import, animated GIF export, and built-in DEV.3 example-project compatibility and migration.',
  'latestRelease.item.docs': 'Added the DEV.3 archive, project statistics, categorized roadmap entries, and roadmap records for themes and extensions.',
  'latestRelease.item.performance': 'Reduced redundant redraws during animation, preview, and dialog adjustments; large home project lists now scroll within their panel.',
